  data: {
    LLM: "As Hâkem, choose a trump suit where you have length and high cards (especially the Ace). Lead trump early to draw out opponents' trumps.\n\nWatch partner's signals. Discarding a specific suit hints at void or desire for that suit. As Hâkem, balance drawing trumps vs. saving them for later tricks.\n\nCount all cards played, especially trumps. Communicate with partner through card choice. When Hâkem, calculate exactly how many trumps opponents hold before committing to a long suit play. Aim for Kot (all 13 tricks) when hand strength allows.",
